{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Personal Bank split deposits respect stack limits (#7018)",
  "contract": "Linen Cloth stacks to 20. Depositing a split of five into a bank stack of eighteen transfers only the two that fit, preserving the three untransferred items. Depositing into a full stack changes neither side. An empty bank slot accepts the requested split. Native packet transfers preserve the total of twenty-eight items.",
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
  "players": [
